const paths=[['workspace','overview'],['crm','client crm'],['venture','venture work'],['escalations','escalations'],['queue','action queue'],['forms','discovery studio'],['catalogue','catalogue'],['people','people & onboarding'],['resources-admin','documents & access'],['content','content studio'],['home','holding website']];
workspace=function(content){return `<aside class="sidebar"><a href="#home"><img class="logo" src="assets/${scope==='holding'?'hamzury':scope==='hamzury hub'?'hub':V.some(v=>v[0]===scope)?scope:'hamzury'}.png" alt="${E(scope==='holding'?'hamzury holding':scope)}"></a><nav>${paths.filter(([p])=>scope==='holding'||!['people','content'].includes(p)).map(([p,t])=>`<a class="${route[0]===p?'active':''}" href="#${p==='venture'&&scope!=='holding'?'venture/'+encodeURIComponent(scope):p}">${t}</a>`).join('')}<a href="#routine">calendar, tasks & standards</a></nav><div class="bottom">${scope==='medialy'?'medialy / shared sales crm':'one standard. clear ownership.'}<br>workspace role preview</div></aside><main class="workspace"><header class="workhead"><span class="eyebrow" style="margin:0">${E(scope==='holding'?'holding':scope)} / ${E(route[0])}</span><label class="scopepick">workspace view<select aria-label="workspace view" onchange="scopeChange(this.value)"><option value="holding" ${scope==='holding'?'selected':''}>holding admin</option>${db.ventures.map(v=>`<option value="${E(v.name)}" ${scope===v.name?'selected':''}>${E(v.name)} workspace</option>`).join('')}</select></label></header>${content}${footer()}</main>`};
const stageColors={'new':'#6e809e','discovery':'#477e91','proposal':'#806197','roadmap':'#b58a35','payment':'#ad713d','onboarding':'#317c80','active':'#34744d','delivered':'#596d32'};
